modifyAgentWeb.zh:
请先读懂这个应用，暂时不要修改任何文件。这次是要修改应用本身，不是日常使用。

{nameLine}项目文件夹：{projectRoot}
平台说明：{skillPath}
平台命令行：{cliPath}

先读平台说明及其 references，再读 panda.json、{instructions} 和其中提到的文档；读不到说明时先告诉我。用一两句话告诉我这个应用做什么、你平时替我做什么，然后问我想改哪里。如果我说的其实是日常操作（比如加一个关注主题），就按 {instructions} 做，不改代码。

修改时请遵守：
- 只修改上面的项目文件夹，其余规则以平台说明为准。{secrets}
- {gitSave}
- {changeSize}
- {dataConsent}
- {schema}
- 改 {instructions} 前先告诉我改什么，它是你平时替我做事的规则。
- 需要构建时按 panda.json 构建。{tools}
- 改完告诉我点应用窗口上的「重新加载」；改了表结构的，提醒我先重新加载一次，再让 AI 处理日常事务。
- {continueChat}

modifyAgentWeb.en:
Please understand this app first. Do not modify any files yet. This time the goal is to change the app itself, not to use it day to day.

{nameLine}Project folder: {projectRoot}
Platform instructions: {skillPath}
Platform command line: {cliPath}

First read the platform instructions and their references, then panda.json, {instructions} and the documents it mentions. Tell me first if you cannot read the instructions. In one or two sentences, tell me what this app does and what you usually do for me, then ask me what I want to change. If what I ask is actually a daily task (such as adding a topic to follow), follow {instructions} and do not change the code.

When making changes:
- Modify only the project folder above. Follow the platform instructions for everything else. {secrets}
- {gitSave}
- {changeSize}
- {dataConsent}
- {schema}
- Before changing {instructions}, tell me what you will change; it holds the rules you follow for my daily tasks.
- Build according to panda.json when needed. {tools}
- When finished, tell me to click Reload on the app window. If the database structure changed, remind me to reload once before asking the AI to do daily tasks.
- {continueChat}

