create.zh:
我想在熊猫小抽屉里做一个新应用，请先和我聊清楚要做什么，暂时不要写代码。

{nameLine}{descriptionLine}项目文件夹：{projectRoot}（平台已经生成了起始项目）
平台说明：{skillPath}
平台命令行：{cliPath}

先读平台说明及其 references 和起始项目的 README。然后用通俗的话问我：这个应用给谁用、最想先做的一件事是什么。问清楚后，说明第一版做哪些、怎么做，等我同意再动手。

做的时候请遵守：
- 只修改上面的项目文件夹，其余规则以平台说明为准。{secrets}
- {gitSave}
- {dataConsent}
- 需要 API Key 时，在 panda.json 声明配置项，由我在平台里填写，不要让我把 Key 发给你；需要后台或密钥时，按平台说明把应用改成 Node 应用。
- 需要构建时按 panda.json 构建。{tools}
- 每完成一步，告诉我点应用窗口上的「重新加载」看效果。

create.en:
I want to make a new app in Panda Drawer. Please first talk with me about what it should do. Do not write code yet.

{nameLine}{descriptionLine}Project folder: {projectRoot} (the platform has already generated a starter project)
Platform instructions: {skillPath}
Platform command line: {cliPath}

First read the platform instructions, their references and the starter project's README. Then ask me in plain words who the app is for and the one thing I most want it to do first. Once that is clear, explain what the first version will include and how you will build it, and wait for my approval before starting.

While building:
- Modify only the project folder above. Follow the platform instructions for everything else. {secrets}
- {gitSave}
- {dataConsent}
- When an API key is needed, declare a configuration field in panda.json so I can fill it in on the platform. Never ask me to send you the key. If the app needs a backend or secrets, convert it to a Node app as described in the platform instructions.
- Build according to panda.json when needed. {tools}
- After each step, tell me to click Reload on the app window to see the result.
